@startuml
' What: the core formula of SYNTROPY (D-24), as refined by D-48.
' Shows: the body casts the hexagram lines; the player picks on them; the pick pattern shapes the profile;
'        profile and random effects add pressure; the soul acts back on the body through climate and era policy.
' Source: brainstorming-base.md, D-24, D-25, D-48.
title Core engine (D-24, D-48)
rectangle "Body\n(Unciv: map, cities, yields)" as BD
rectangle "I Ching\nreading + rules of change\n(hexagram per realm)" as IC
rectangle "Profile\n(5 disturbing emotions\n<-> 5 wisdoms)" as PR
rectangle "Random effects" as RND
actor "Player" as PL
BD --> IC : casts the lines
IC --> PL : line keywords +\nsituation summary
PL --> IC : most / least picks\n(changing lines)
PL --> PR : pattern of picks\nshapes the profile
PR --> IC : pressure toward the\ncurrent pole, number of picks
IC --> PR : situation feeds\nemotions / wisdoms
RND --> IC : event pressure,\ndice near the threshold
IC --> BD : climate + era policy
@enduml
